<title>AUSTRALIA: Mayne Nickless forms Malaysian jt venture.</title>
<headline>Mayne Nickless forms Malaysian jt venture.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Express transport and logistics company Mayne Nickless Ltd said on Monday that it had formed a logistics joint venture in Malaysia with Halim Mazmin Bhd and Malaysian Capital Ventures Sdn Bhd (MCV).</p>
<p>It said the joint venture firm, called Online Distribution Services Sdn Bhd, would trade as Mayne Nickless Logistics and be 51 percent held by its two Malaysian partners.</p>
<p>Mayne Nickless would retain management responsibility for the business.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
